      premises: [],
      fromDefinitions: true,
      foundation: true,
      formula: String.raw`a = qb + r,\quad 0 \le r < b`,
      text: "For every integer a and every natural number b there are unique integers q and r with a = qb + r and 0 ≤ r < b.",
